   "text": "Production runs with TOOLYARD_SKILLS=off:\nno stdio servers, MemPalace off. It cannot\nwork with several replicas, because each\nreplica has its own disk.",
   "originalText": "Production runs with TOOLYARD_SKILLS=off:\nno stdio servers, MemPalace off. It cannot\nwork with several replicas, because each\nreplica has its own disk.",
