   "text": "A source is a repository, a\nbranch and a folder.\nIt reads with one of:\n\u2022 nothing (public)\n\u2022 the source's own token\n(sealed, write-only)\n\u2022 the creator's GitHub\nconnection\n\u2022 the default instance token\n(GitHub access)",
   "originalText": "A source is a repository, a\nbranch and a folder.\nIt reads with one of:\n\u2022 nothing (public)\n\u2022 the source's own token\n(sealed, write-only)\n\u2022 the creator's GitHub\nconnection\n\u2022 the default instance token\n(GitHub access)",
   "fontSize": 14,
